  <dashboards>
    <dashboard _.fcp.AccessibleZoneTabOrder.true...enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='Definitions'>
      <layout-options>
        <title>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='15'>Definitions:</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </title>
      </layout-options>
      <repository-location derived-from='https://tableau.deliveryhero.net/t/GlobalStandardReporting/workbooks/Expansion-WIP/Definitions?rev=' id='Definitions' path='/t/GlobalStandardReporting/workbooks/StoreDevelopmentDashboard-2' revision='' site='GlobalStandardReporting' />
      <style />
      <size maxheight='700' maxwidth='1000' minheight='700' minwidth='1000' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='4' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='97714' id='5' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98400' x='800' y='1143'>
            <zone fixed-size='32' h='5714' id='7' is-fixed='true' type-v2='title' w='98400' x='800' y='1143'>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
            <zone forceUpdate='true' h='72429' id='108' type-v2='text' w='98400' x='800' y='6857'>
              <formatted-text>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='15'>Definitions:</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='11'>Dmart mau</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='11'> - Customers who ordered from the Dmart Warehouse for that Month.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='11'>Platform mau</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='11'> - Customers who ordered any type of platform = dmarts, food, local store on that month from the warehouse</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='11'>Dmart Covered mau or coverage</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='11'> - platform mau that are within dmart delivery areas</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='11'>Dmart Penetration</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='11'> - Total number of Dmart mau divided by the total number of Platform mau that are within Dmart Delivery areas.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='15'>Filters:</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='11'>Last Month Dmart Covered mau</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='11'>: Allows the end user to choose the dmart covered mau to be greater or lesser than the entered threshold</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='15'>Scope:</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='11'>The aim of the project is to know each global entity, region, country, management entity, warehouses last six months Dmart Covered mau, Dmart penetration, Platform mau,Dmart mau which helps in Store Expansion decision making process.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='15'>Tabs:</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='11'>Monthly mau</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='11'>Æ </run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='11'>Bar charts in the column dmart covered mau is sorted from highest to low platform mau within the dmart delivery zone for each country </run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='11'>Last 6 Month Dmarts mau</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='11'>Summary of the Last 6 months dmart mau and growth over month for each dmart. Cells are highlighted in dark green colour where the mau for that month is higher in comparison to the anyother month in the table. </run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='11'>Last 6 Month Dmarts count</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='11'>The stacked bar chart shows the count of active dmarts for each month, colour green shows the count of dmarts with last month dmart covered mau greater than entered threshold and colour blue shows the count of dmarts with last month dmart covered mau lesser than the given threshold</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='11'>Active Dmart</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='11'>: </run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'>Any Dmart that has successful order in the last month is called as active dmart </run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='11'>Note: </run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='11'>Data source includes all Active Dmarts excluding: Glovo, eFood Greece, Woowa Korea</run>
              </formatted-text>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
      </zones>
